tool_input.command:
gunzip -c .xping/sessions/*.json.gz | python3 -c "
import json,sys
d=json.load(sys.stdin)
def walk(o,p='',depth=0):
    if isinstance(o,dict):
        for k,v in o.items():
            if isinstance(v,(dict,list)): 
                print(p+k, type(v).__name__, len(v))
                if depth<2: walk(v,p+k+'.',depth+1)
            else: print(p+k,'=',str(v)[:150])
    elif isinstance(o,list) and o: walk(o[0],p+'[0].',depth+1)
walk(d)"
